      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "✗ CIDRs must never overlap\n✗ routes edited in BOTH VPCs\n✗ opens a full L3 path both ways —\n  SGs/NACLs must claw it back\n✗ not transitive\n✓ no hourly cost, lowest latency",
