      "updated": 1,
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "✗ CIDRs must never overlap\n✗ TGW route tables + VPC routes\n✗ a hub someone has to own\n✓ scales to many VPCs / on-prem\n✓ central inspection possible\n$ per attachment-hour + per GB",
